{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jokano is a fast-paced, strategic card game with a unique charm! In this retro-futuristic adventure, timeless gameplay meets deep strategy and a heartwarming story. Join FranKI, a lovable robot from the planet Kybernia-7, whose spaceship has crash-landed on Earth. Your mission: help him recover his scattered rocket parts by proving your skills in thrilling card duels.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of Jokano lies the innovative Joker System. Earn money by winning rounds, then visit the shop between matches to expand your Joker inventory. Unlock over 35 unique Jokers, from permanent upgrades that forever change your playstyle to powerful one-time Jokers that can turn the tide at the perfect moment. Block attacks, double your turns, manipulate the deck, or destabilize your opponent\u2019s finances!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that\u2019s not all. Jokano offers much more than a quick game on the side:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode:</strong> Travel the world with FranKI! Each of the 10 unique worlds, from the icy North Pole to fiery Mount Etna, brings you one step closer to repairing his spaceship and introduces new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical K.O. Mode:</strong> In later worlds, it\u2019s not just about winning, it\u2019s about surviving! Manage your health points, strike directly at your opponent, and use healing or shield abilities to stay in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Experience:</strong> Choose from different decks, adjust AI difficulty, or relax in \u201cFree Play\u201d mode against FranKI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Charm:</strong> Immerse yourself in a lovingly crafted pixel-art world paired with an atmospheric soundtrack reminiscent of the golden age of arcade games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jokano is a timeless classic that will challenge you again and again. Every match is different, every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to help FranKI and become the ultimate Jokano master?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3994950?t=1763889223","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3994950?t=1763889223","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994950/f547b2556f871e154f716e5638e9bc542bc4d3bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763889223","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994950/f547b2556f871e154f716e5638e9bc542bc4d3bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763889223","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jokano is a fast-paced, strategic card game with a unique charm! In this retro-futuristic adventure, timeless gameplay meets deep strategy and a heartwarming story. Join FranKI, a lovable robot from the planet Kybernia-7, whose spaceship has crash-landed on Earth. Your mission: help him recover his scattered rocket parts by proving your skills in thrilling card duels.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of Jokano lies the innovative Joker System. Earn money by winning rounds, then visit the shop between matches to expand your Joker inventory. Unlock over 35 unique Jokers, from permanent upgrades that forever change your playstyle to powerful one-time Jokers that can turn the tide at the perfect moment. Block attacks, double your turns, manipulate the deck, or destabilize your opponent\u2019s finances!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that\u2019s not all. Jokano offers much more than a quick game on the side:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode:</strong> Travel the world with FranKI! Each of the 10 unique worlds, from the icy North Pole to fiery Mount Etna, brings you one step closer to repairing his spaceship and introduces new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical K.O. Mode:</strong> In later worlds, it\u2019s not just about winning, it\u2019s about surviving! Manage your health points, strike directly at your opponent, and use healing or shield abilities to stay in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Experience:</strong> Choose from different decks, adjust AI difficulty, or relax in \u201cFree Play\u201d mode against FranKI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Charm:</strong> Immerse yourself in a lovingly crafted pixel-art world paired with an atmospheric soundtrack reminiscent of the golden age of arcade games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jokano is a timeless classic that will challenge you again and again. Every match is different, every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to help FranKI and become the ultimate Jokano master?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["SkyFly0816"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994950/7ecbb8a4c7a63cbce4876020d9f073bdc331